Regarding the drugs used, all anesthetics reduce blood pressure and they are thus associated with a hypotensive state. Midazolam has a significant positive effect, indicating that higher concentration of this drug  in the blood is associated with increased odds of experiencing hypotension during surgery. For the other drugs, the estimated coefficients are not significant. 
