\label{fig:thre_scan}
\end{figure}

\subsection{Amplitude \& Charge}
\label{2:features}

In total, 280 dynode- and 621 MCP-potted 20-inch PMTs have been tested. Fig.\,\ref{fig:waveform} shows one
recorded waveform in the fine range and coarse range for comparison. The triggered pulse located at around 600\,ns in the readout window of [0,10]\,$\mu$s.
%In addition to the threshold$_{1}$ previously set in electronics shown in Fig.\,\ref{fig:rate:threshold1}, we also defined the threshold$_{2}$ in Fig.\,\ref{fig:rate:threshold2} to check the threshold, which is the amplitude at 50\% of the peak of the amplitude spectrum. 
With the test, a total of 681 PMTs were measured with a threshold of 1000\,ADCs, and the remaining ones have been tested with 4000\,ADCs. %Threshold$_{1}$ and threshold$_{2}$ were slightly different. 

\begin{figure}[!htb]
