    \centering
    \begin{tikzpicture}
       \drawExampleActionFigure
    \end{tikzpicture}
    \caption{Example of the application of the (a) absorption algorithm, where the dark blue gate is absorbed into the RSF, and (b) disentangling algorithm, where the light gray gate is removed from the RSF, by applying a gate (depicted in red) in the second bond. The numbers above the arrows indicate which step of the algorithm is applied (see main text).}
