Parallel performance will be extracted by associating each partition to a computational resource (MPI processes, in this implementation). 
The submatrices may be sized arbitrarily, with $\M{A}_i$ of size $n_i$. 
The only true restriction is $n_i > \bw$, although for load balancing purposes each partition should be roughly the same size. 
