Central to the \spike{} algorithm is the \Mt{DS} factorization.  
The matrix is factored into $\M{D}$, a block diagonal matrix, containing the submatrices $\M{A}_i$; and $\M{S}$, a block tridiagonal matrix. 
The partitioning is as follows,

