\begin{lemma}
 $\mathbf{A}_k$ and  $\mathbf{S}_k$ are a action and a state matrix. For any subset $\Omega \subset\{1, \ldots, p\}$, and $\tilde{\mathbf{A}}_k$ obatined by resampling, we have
