\left(\left[\mathbf{A}_k , \tilde{\mathbf{A}}_k\right]_{\operatorname{swap}(\Omega)},\mathbf{S}_k\right) \stackrel{d}{=}\left(\left[\mathbf{A}_k , \tilde{\mathbf{A}}_k\right],\mathbf{S}_k\right),
