W_i\left(\left[\mathbf{A}_k ,\tilde{\mathbf{A}}_k\right]_{\operatorname{swap}(\Omega)}, \mathbf{S}_k, \mathbf{Y}_k\right)=W_i\left(\left[\mathbf{A}_k ,\tilde{\mathbf{A}}_k\right], \mathbf{S}_k, \mathbf{Y}_k\right) \cdot \begin{cases}-1, & \text { if } i \in \Omega \\ +1, & \text { otherwise }\end{cases}.
