\section{Supplemental Material}

We present the implementation of the three-body force, proof of the positivity, and the details of the Coulomb interaction. Note that these contents can also be found in other literature; we include it for self-sufficiency. We also discuss details of the optimization algorithm, computational complexity, and finite volume effects. We provide results for nucleon-nucleon phase shifts, odd-even staggering in oxygen isotopes, the pure neutron matter equation of state, and charge density distributions. The numerical results and original data are provided as detailed tables and combined figures.


