  \caption{Illustration of Gaussian distributions for initializing agents' opinions based on survey answers. The concern threshold $c_{\text{th}}=0.7$ defines the minimum opinion value for concern in this example. Upper-half distributions share the same standard deviation and divide $[c_{\text{th}}, 1]$ into three equal intervals.}
