\subsubsection{Effectiveness of UQ-informed Human Correction}
The results in Fig.~\ref{fig:before_afterHC} indicate that UQ-informed human intervention successfully eliminates the majority of extraction errors without requiring a full review of all extracted table cells. The accuracy of the extracted data improves by about 30\%, increasing from 53\% to 83\% overall. In particular, the data accuracy of Computer Science is improved the most,  from 53\% to 97\%.


