\label{sec:prompt_detect_fraud_related}
Figure~\ref{prompt:classify_accounting_fraud} shows the prompt used to assess whether amendment reasons are related to accounting fraud violations. Figure~\ref{fig:fraud_detection_confusion_matrix} and \ref{fig:fraud_detection_confusion_matrix_openai} shows the confusion matrices for each model. Figure~\ref{fig:sonnet_3.7_response_fraud_detection} and \ref{fig:gpt_4o_response_fraud_detection} show examples of model responses.
\begin{figure}[h]
