\begin{abstract}
    We establish an unfolding theorem for equivariant F-bundles (a variant of Frobenius manifolds), generalizing Hertling-Manin's universal unfolding of meromorphic connections.
    As an application, we obtain the mirror symmetry theorem for the big quantum cohomology of flag varieties, from the recent works on the small quantum cohomology mirror symmetry, via the equivariant unfolding theorem.
\end{abstract}



