\label{sec:deformable_templates}
Deformable templates, or atlases, are common in computational anatomy. 
Research is dedicated to constructing unbiased templates such that the deformation fields from these templates to individual images can be analyzed to understand population variability~\cite{BLAIOTTA2018117,christensen1997volumetric,GANSER20043}. 
