More recently, template learning approaches use neural networks to learn templates that are data-driven and attribute-specific~\cite{dalca2019learningconditionaldeformable,dey2022generativeadversarialregistrationimproved,starck2024diffdefdiffusiongenerateddeformationfields}. 
These approaches aim to build decoders that learn templates conditioned on specified attributes.
